#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_page.py:460
msgid ""
"The BigCommunity kernel (big-kernel), optimized for gaming and general use "
"(BORE, Clang ThinLTO, Intel fixes). It is installed alongside your current "
"kernel."
msgstr ""
"Jądro BigCommunity (big-kernel), zoptymalizowane pod kątem gier i "
"codziennego użytku (BORE, Clang ThinLTO, poprawki dla Intela). Zostanie "
"zainstalowane obok obecnego jądra."

#: usr/share/big-driver-manager/ui/kernel_page.py:465
msgid ""
"Recommended for most users. These kernels receive security updates for years"
" and are thoroughly tested."
msgstr ""
